  "description": "Five rounds of double-kettlebell carries and lunges (front-rack lunge 25 ft, overhead carry 50 ft, front-rack carry 75 ft, farmers carry 100 ft) woven with 9 strict pull-ups, 16 hand-release push-ups, 23 air squats and a 400 m run, in a vest if you have one. Honours U.S. Air Force combat controller Senior Airman Daniel R. Sanchez, killed in Kajran District, Afghanistan, in 2010. Use 53/35 lb bells; scale to one bell if needed.",
